{"name": "Rift Protocol", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rift Protocol</strong> is a real-time squad tactics roguelite. You don\u2019t control one hero, you command up to three soldiers as one entity, through a procedurally generated underground laboratory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras_big/2166f6aaa81aa8cfb2f6d6750fe33dc9.avif?t=1786470106\" height=\"504\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/2166f6aaa81aa8cfb2f6d6750fe33dc9.avif?t=1786470106\" width=\"1560\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"66\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/9f87c37f29cd1e498ea4b19362b2b6ce.avif?t=1786470106\" width=\"1232\"/></span><strong>COMMAND A SQUAD, NOT A LONE SOLDIER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Direct up to three soldiers with squad wide commands. Hold formation, focus fire on priority targets, or split the team when an objective demands it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/fc7c2ee79a4f2c47fa560f8e2ee09077.poster.avif?t=1786470106\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/fc7c2ee79a4f2c47fa560f8e2ee09077.webm?t=1786470106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/fc7c2ee79a4f2c47fa560f8e2ee09077.mp4?t=1786470106\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"66\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/9f87c37f29cd1e498ea4b19362b2b6ce.avif?t=1786470106\" width=\"1232\"/></span><strong>SLOW TIME. MAKE THE CALL.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter Tactical Focus when the situation turns against you. Aim abilities, spend Command Points, deploy turrets, throw smoke, and turn dangerous rooms into defensible positions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/f1ef1a940617fde87460dd9038529b97.poster.avif?t=1786470106\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/f1ef1a940617fde87460dd9038529b97.webm?t=1786470106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/f1ef1a940617fde87460dd9038529b97.mp4?t=1786470106\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"66\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/9f87c37f29cd1e498ea4b19362b2b6ce.avif?t=1786470106\" width=\"1232\"/></span><strong>EVERY RUN REBUILDS THE FACILITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally generated sectors change their layouts, loot, threats, and objectives. Search rift infested laboratories and reach the exit before your supplies, or your soldiers, run out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/901abbf69980db1b2eb408822203dca4.poster.avif?t=1786470106\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/901abbf69980db1b2eb408822203dca4.webm?t=1786470106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"66\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/9f87c37f29cd1e498ea4b19362b2b6ce.avif?t=1786470106\" width=\"1232\"/></span><strong>HACK, REPAIR, AND IMPROVISE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not every obstacle can be solved with gunfire. Hack terminals, repair or seal doors, recover keycards, replace air filters, and carry unstable rift cores while the rest of your squad protects the objective.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/d3f6941e647c9dca67291afbb7645416.poster.avif?t=1786470106\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/d3f6941e647c9dca67291afbb7645416.webm?t=1786470106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/d3f6941e647c9dca67291afbb7645416.mp4?t=1786470106\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"66\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/9f87c37f29cd1e498ea4b19362b2b6ce.avif?t=1786470106\" width=\"1232\"/></span><strong>EVERY SOLDIER CARRIES THE CONSEQUENCES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wounds can hinder your soldiers instead of merely reducing HP. If the squad falls, the run ends, but a Save Soldier station can preserve one veteran for your next attempt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"512\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/4c575ac3559254e5abf1a5f02e4e1d09.poster.avif?t=1786470106\" width=\"910\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/4c575ac3559254e5abf1a5f02e4e1d09.webm?t=1786470106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/4c575ac3559254e5abf1a5f02e4e1d09.mp4?t=1786470106\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"66\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/9f87c37f29cd1e498ea4b19362b2b6ce.avif?t=1786470106\" width=\"1232\"/></span><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Real-time control of a squad of up to three soldiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tactical Focus slow-motion command system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally generated facility sectors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Formations, focus fire, suppression and defensive positions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat, hacking, repairs and multitasking objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Persistent injuries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resource management involving ammunition, medical supplies and tools.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"231\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/extras/6c29c64e6be074ca73108439ae61481b.avif?t=1786470106\" width=\"1232\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A tense, real-time squad tactics roguelike inspired by Aliens: Dark Descent. Command up to three soldiers through a procedurally generated facility full of monsters. Plan attacks, slow time for tactical skills, and scavenge to survive. One bad call and your squad is gone for good.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468970/34b752eeb4119c49a07e70ca0993f52d5d2cc4e7/header.jpg?t=1786470106", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Strategy", "Roguelike", "RTS", "Action RTS", "Real Time Tactics"], "developers": "Soft Pixel", "publishers": "Soft Pixel", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4468970", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "10 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/45sBm94ptmg", "first_seen": 1786320000.0}